OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers uncover 2,000-year-old
OL,4,Asettlement
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have uncovered a rare Iron
OL,7,FAge settlement built about 2,000 years
OL,8,Fago.
OL,10,FThe Deepdale Bridge Settlement revealed
OL,11,Fseveral hut circles and small
OL,12,Fenclosures in the Lake District's
OL,13,FDeepdale Valley in a dig by 25 Lake
OL,14,FDistrict National Park volunteers.
OL,16,FCharcoal present in the soil revealed
OL,17,Fthat the huts were occupied between 76
OL,18,Fand 216 AD and the enclosure bank was
OL,19,Fconstructed between 40 BC and 118 AD,
OL,20,Fthe Lake District National Park
OL,21,FAuthority (LDNPA) said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
