OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers uncover 2,000-year-old
OL,4,Asettlement
OL,5,
OL,6,FEden Heritage archaeological consultant
OL,7,FMartin Railton said there was
OL,8,F"surprisingly little" history on the
OL,9,Fpeople who lived and farmed in the
OL,10,Farea, with the excavation helping "to
OL,11,Fshed light on several other
OL,12,Fsettlements".
